WEBVTT

00:14.630 --> 00:19.600
The sweet whispers of love only happen twice.

00:20.870 --> 00:25.970
Before you know it, you're taken prisoner. Chocolat à la folie.

00:27.470 --> 00:32.390
The stardust of dawn is inlaid in the sky.

00:33.850 --> 00:38.820
My emerald eyes have you in their sights!

00:40.250 --> 00:45.030
Sugar Sugar Rune! Choco Choco Rune!

00:46.630 --> 00:51.470
The sparkling hearts are secret jewels.

00:52.950 --> 00:58.220
Even if the boys bully you,

00:59.370 --> 01:04.370
They've just fallen in love. Chocolat à la folie.

01:05.880 --> 01:10.860
They're really in love with you. Chocolat à la folie.

01:23.390 --> 01:25.200
Chocolat à la folie.

01:28.520 --> 01:30.020
We're home!

01:30.020 --> 01:33.420
Vanilla-chama, congratulations!

01:35.920 --> 01:40.090
Oh? What are we celebrating?

01:40.730 --> 01:46.290
That Vanilla-chama has, as of now,
collected 100,000 ecure!

01:47.740 --> 01:50.240
Chocolat, how many ecure do you have?

01:50.240 --> 01:51.570
30,000.

01:54.310 --> 01:58.310
You're just falling more and more behind
Vanilla-chama, aren't you?

02:02.580 --> 02:06.010
Vanilla-chama, congratulations on 100,000 ecure!

02:06.990 --> 02:09.420
Thank you, Blanca.

02:09.420 --> 02:11.430
Keep on working hard.

02:12.190 --> 02:13.700
That's amazing, Vanilla.

02:13.700 --> 02:18.330
No, it's not. You're working hard
too, right Chocolat-chan?

02:19.470 --> 02:22.040
I'm working hard, sure. But...

02:23.620 --> 02:26.770
Chocolat and Vanilla: A Love Triangle?

02:30.010 --> 02:33.650
I've got to do something or I'll just keep
falling more and more behind.

02:34.450 --> 02:36.590
Can you think of some kind of plan?

02:37.190 --> 02:39.990
Hmm, a plan, huh?

02:40.990 --> 02:43.120
Ah, the fortune telling book!

02:43.830 --> 02:48.930
Hold up your wand and recite the
spell, and I'll tell your fortune.

02:50.300 --> 02:52.770
Sugar Sugar Rune, Choco Rune!

02:54.170 --> 02:56.540
Divination Livre!

02:59.110 --> 03:02.040
How should I get someone's heart, guaranteed?

03:08.520 --> 03:10.880
The Aiming Cupid.

03:12.390 --> 03:13.690
Aim?

03:14.160 --> 03:15.560
Zap!

03:15.560 --> 03:18.460
Narrow your targets, that's the trick!

03:23.930 --> 03:29.270
That's it! Decide whose heart you're going
to take, and then focus on that boy!

03:29.270 --> 03:31.020
Sounds like a good plan to me!

03:35.380 --> 03:38.610
I see... You think that'll work?

03:41.880 --> 03:44.180
So whose heart should I aim for?

03:45.820 --> 03:46.440
Heya!

03:47.590 --> 03:49.790
I'd just end up fighting with Mimura.

03:51.390 --> 03:53.290
Good morning!

03:54.060 --> 03:56.750
And Ijuuin's a fan of Vanilla's.

04:01.770 --> 04:03.140
What is it?

04:03.140 --> 04:04.110
Who's that?

04:04.110 --> 04:07.770
Oh, that's got to be the president
of the middle school student council,

04:07.770 --> 04:09.740
Shinohara-san, that I've heard about.

04:11.350 --> 04:12.890
Ah, good morning.

04:19.790 --> 04:20.900
Chocolat-chan?

04:21.820 --> 04:23.560
Alright, I've decided.

04:23.560 --> 04:25.390
I'll aim for that guy!

04:29.230 --> 04:30.130
Shinohara-san?

04:31.670 --> 04:32.530
Who are you?

04:33.640 --> 04:35.640
I was with Vanilla this morning.

04:35.640 --> 04:36.600
Oh.

04:36.600 --> 04:39.170
I'm Chocolat Kato from class 5-A.

04:39.170 --> 04:40.310
Pleased to meetcha!

04:40.310 --> 04:41.940
And? What did you want?

04:43.080 --> 04:44.590
Shall we have lunch together?

04:45.180 --> 04:49.100
And why must I have lunch
together with you?

04:51.520 --> 04:53.550
If you don't have a reason, then I won't.

04:57.160 --> 05:01.730
Chocolat, what's with the sudden
interest in Shinohara-san?

05:02.500 --> 05:07.870
Well, he's cool, smart, and the most
popular in the Middle School.

05:07.870 --> 05:14.710
But Shinohara-san always seems absorbed in his
studies and has no interest in girls, it's not easy.

05:15.210 --> 05:17.670
He's rejected so many girls...

05:21.950 --> 05:23.920
The most popular, eh?

05:23.920 --> 05:26.340
I'm getting more and more pumped up about this!

05:31.630 --> 05:33.610
Um, Shinohara-san?

05:34.300 --> 05:35.600
Oh, Vanilla...

05:36.030 --> 05:38.070
May I sit next to you?

05:38.870 --> 05:39.500
Go ahead.

05:40.130 --> 05:46.570
You even study during lunch. That's an amazing
amount of effort you put in, Shinohara-san.

05:46.840 --> 05:49.240
It's only through effort that one opens
opportunities for oneself, right?

05:49.580 --> 05:53.280
Yes, I also love trying to do my best all the time!

05:56.820 --> 06:01.390
A pink heart? Why?

06:01.390 --> 06:03.810
Let me inform you.

06:04.490 --> 06:10.800
Shinohara-san's type is a girl who is
serious, smart, mature, and cute.

06:11.470 --> 06:13.700
And why do you know this?

06:13.700 --> 06:16.970
I've named it "The Aiming Cupid" plan!

06:16.970 --> 06:17.840
What?!

06:17.840 --> 06:20.210
You were spying on me last night?!

06:20.210 --> 06:23.480
That'll definitely turn into a red heart.

06:23.480 --> 06:26.570
And then Vanilla-chama will get it!

06:26.880 --> 06:30.250
Wait a sec! I had my eye on him just before!

06:30.250 --> 06:32.450
There's no waiting in line for love.

06:36.590 --> 06:40.080
You see, I was aiming for Shinohara first.

06:40.500 --> 06:41.930
Oh, I see.

06:41.930 --> 06:47.140
I'm sorry, Blanca told me that I could
definitely take his heart, so...

06:47.140 --> 06:52.740
Ice-san, I'll explain that problem you
asked about before after school.

06:52.740 --> 06:54.110
Oh, really?

06:55.140 --> 06:56.350
Sure.

06:57.600 --> 06:59.450
Okay, at the library.

06:59.450 --> 07:01.600
Thank you very much.

07:03.420 --> 07:05.990
He's just helping me with some math problems...

07:05.990 --> 07:07.990
Fine, go ahead.

07:07.990 --> 07:09.100
But...

07:09.460 --> 07:10.240
But...

07:11.630 --> 07:15.100
It's a battle to see who gets Shinohara's heart!

07:16.530 --> 07:19.180
Okay, it starts after school.

07:22.540 --> 07:24.340
I ain't gonna lose!

07:28.380 --> 07:31.310
"Private Lesson of Love" plan, start!

07:33.820 --> 07:36.460
When you're trying to find the area of a polygon,

07:36.460 --> 07:38.790
change the shape without changing the total area.

07:38.790 --> 07:41.320
Try and change it to something where
the area is easier to figure out.

07:41.820 --> 07:43.990
It's "same area, different shape'' right?

07:43.990 --> 07:47.500
You catch on so quickly, it's
easy to teach you, Ice-san.

07:47.500 --> 07:51.280
Thank you very much, Shinohara-senp... Ah...

07:52.270 --> 07:55.440
Is it okay if I call you "Senpai"?

07:56.740 --> 07:58.840
Sure.

08:01.180 --> 08:02.290
Ah, again!

08:03.040 --> 08:05.280
I'll call him Senpai too!

08:06.250 --> 08:07.710
Shinohara-senpai!

08:09.780 --> 08:11.290
Chocolat-chan...

08:11.290 --> 08:13.340
Hey, want to go out on a date with me?

08:13.690 --> 08:14.460
Eh?

08:14.460 --> 08:15.360
A date?

08:15.920 --> 08:17.690
It'll be really fun, for sure.

08:18.430 --> 08:21.560
By "for sure" do you mean a 100% chance?

08:23.160 --> 08:24.770
And what do you base that on?

08:25.530 --> 08:26.800
Base it on?

08:26.800 --> 08:28.840
It's not something like that...

08:28.840 --> 08:30.960
Anyway, you can't just study all the time.

08:30.960 --> 08:33.320
Sometimes you have to change things up, you know?

08:34.060 --> 08:34.700
I refuse.

08:36.910 --> 08:39.450
I have no reason to go on a date with you.

08:39.450 --> 08:42.520
And furthermore, I enjoy studying all the time.

08:43.850 --> 08:46.020
Cho... Chocolat-chan...

08:46.790 --> 08:49.920
Okay, in that case...

08:51.930 --> 08:55.160
Sugar Sugar Rune, Choco Rune!

08:58.630 --> 08:59.140
Wand!

09:11.600 --> 09:13.050
Alright!

09:13.050 --> 09:14.710
Angel wings, appear!

09:36.400 --> 09:38.310
Chocolat-chan, that's so pushy...

09:42.610 --> 09:44.510
I'm flying in the sky...

09:45.010 --> 09:46.010
I don't believe it!

09:46.010 --> 09:47.510
This is some dream or hallucination.

09:53.360 --> 09:55.070
Oh no! The magic disappeared!

10:00.190 --> 10:02.530
Sugar Sugar Rune, Choco Rune!

10:09.000 --> 10:09.840
Senpai!

10:11.270 --> 10:12.110
Senpai!

10:13.940 --> 10:15.460
Shinohara-senpai!

10:17.980 --> 10:19.250
Where am I?

10:19.250 --> 10:21.080
I could've sworn I was flying...

10:21.780 --> 10:24.220
No! That was a hallucination...

10:24.220 --> 10:25.350
Gotta be a dream!

10:25.350 --> 10:29.190
And the proof is that even though
I fell, I'm not injured!

10:29.190 --> 10:31.360
Shinohara-senpai, going somewhere?

10:31.360 --> 10:34.160
I've found this really classy cafe, see, and...

10:34.160 --> 10:36.630
No, I'm going home to study.

10:38.770 --> 10:39.630
Beat it.

10:40.500 --> 10:42.270
He just dumped you without
a second thought!

10:42.270 --> 10:45.070
Don't just comment on it, do something!

10:45.540 --> 10:46.800
Fine, got it.

10:47.310 --> 10:48.780
Wait, Senpai!

10:48.780 --> 10:50.950
In that case, let's study together!

10:50.950 --> 10:52.810
What are you studying?

10:52.810 --> 10:55.350
Today I planned on studying World Geography.

10:55.980 --> 10:56.850
In that case...

10:58.520 --> 11:01.340
Sugar Sugar Rune, Choco Rune!

11:01.340 --> 11:03.560
Go to Paris!

11:10.670 --> 11:11.970
This is...

11:11.970 --> 11:13.800
Ou'est-ce qu'on mange ce soir?
(What are we eating tonight?)

11:14.840 --> 11:16.970
A city for lovers, the flower of Paris.

11:17.610 --> 11:19.370
It's a city for love and the arts!

11:22.380 --> 11:23.610
The Arc de Triomphe...

11:24.350 --> 11:26.050
Isn't it romantic?

11:26.050 --> 11:27.820
Okay, that's enough geography.

11:27.820 --> 11:29.350
Eh?

11:29.350 --> 11:31.750
Okay, let's study history!

11:33.220 --> 11:34.120
This is...

11:34.760 --> 11:39.790
Versailles was built in the second half of
the 17th century by King Louis the 14th.

11:40.590 --> 11:43.060
It was where Marie Antoinette lived.

11:43.060 --> 11:44.860
Isn't it fantastic?

11:49.800 --> 11:54.040
The Pyramids are being studied
as ancient tombs for pharaohs.

11:54.710 --> 11:56.180
Isn't it dynamic?

11:59.150 --> 12:03.750
If I'm seeing visions like this,
maybe I need to rest a little.

12:04.790 --> 12:06.920
Maybe I went a bit too far?

12:06.920 --> 12:07.990
Gotcha.

12:10.290 --> 12:12.390
I'm already so tired today...

12:12.830 --> 12:14.390
I'm going home to rest.

12:16.800 --> 12:18.830
I guess my plan failed.

12:30.580 --> 12:33.510
How to take the heart of a straight-laced
honor student?

12:34.180 --> 12:37.420
We can't just tell you, Chocolat.

12:37.420 --> 12:39.480
What should I do?

12:39.850 --> 12:44.020
Come now, the sunset is so pretty,
let's eat dinner out here.

12:44.930 --> 12:46.260
How beautiful...

12:49.130 --> 12:52.030
Houx, Saule, you really have great taste.

12:52.930 --> 12:54.770
The cheese fondue is delicious as well.

12:55.670 --> 12:57.440
I'm glad you like it.

12:57.910 --> 12:58.270
Yeah.

13:00.210 --> 13:04.780
That's it. I'm sure that Shinohara-senpai
will be happy if I praise him.

13:05.350 --> 13:07.210
"Super Suck-Up" plan, let's go!

13:08.080 --> 13:08.990
Wow!

13:08.430 --> 13:08.470
Shinohara Tatsuya

13:08.700 --> 13:08.730
Top Test Scores

13:09.200 --> 13:09.230
6th Grade Literature

13:10.350 --> 13:11.790
That's Shinohara-kun for you!

13:12.590 --> 13:15.690
You got a 100 on that really hard test!

13:15.690 --> 13:17.930
Naw, it wasn't anything special.

13:17.930 --> 13:19.530
Shinohara-senpai!

13:19.530 --> 13:21.500
You really are smart, aren't you?

13:21.500 --> 13:24.800
All the girls in my class think you're amazing.

13:25.470 --> 13:27.280
Everyone's making too much of this.

13:27.280 --> 13:28.950
Ah, it looks like it's working...

13:29.270 --> 13:31.310
Oh, I respect you so much!

13:31.310 --> 13:35.040
People who study are sooo cool!

13:35.040 --> 13:36.380
Aww...

13:36.380 --> 13:37.380
What's this?

13:38.210 --> 13:38.980
Chocolat Kato?

13:42.180 --> 13:43.600
Only 5 percent?

13:43.920 --> 13:46.220
How could someone score that low?

13:46.220 --> 13:47.490
I can't believe it!

13:47.490 --> 13:50.690
Oh please, don't praise me like that.

13:50.690 --> 13:52.130
I'm not praising you!

13:55.630 --> 13:57.100
I'm sorry.

13:57.100 --> 14:00.800
You only missed one problem. A 95% is wonderful.

14:01.270 --> 14:04.280
I just wasn't thinking for that problem.

14:07.240 --> 14:09.240
Another pink heart!

14:11.250 --> 14:13.980
You're the one who dropped the tests, aren't you?

14:13.980 --> 14:17.750
It's only a matter of time till Vanilla-chama
gets that red heart.

14:18.590 --> 14:22.320
Aww, the "Super Suck-Up" plan failed too...

14:24.630 --> 14:28.360
Kato-san, your last math test was terrible!

14:28.360 --> 14:28.970
Here's your punishment!

14:29.300 --> 14:30.500
This is homework.

14:31.030 --> 14:34.540
You must go over the basics CAREFULLY.

14:34.540 --> 14:38.000
And try, and try, and try again!

14:40.510 --> 14:44.040
I can't take any hearts, and I've
got all this homework...

14:46.350 --> 14:50.450
Today I'll explain that problem you
couldn't get yesterday to you.

14:50.450 --> 14:51.020
Okay!

14:52.420 --> 14:54.490
It's not like me to give up!

14:54.920 --> 14:57.620
I've got to try, try, try again!

14:59.660 --> 15:01.830
Can I study here too?

15:01.830 --> 15:05.210
I don't really care, just don't get in our way.

15:08.540 --> 15:09.740
Have I lost?

15:11.310 --> 15:12.940
Okay, let's continue.

15:12.940 --> 15:14.040
Okay.

15:14.040 --> 15:18.280
So how can you figure out the area
of a parallelogram anyway?

15:18.280 --> 15:20.250
It's base times height.

15:20.250 --> 15:21.580
Oh, I see.

15:21.580 --> 15:24.520
And next, you combine these terms and...

15:24.520 --> 15:28.520
Eh?! I don't know how to get the
area of any of these shapes!

15:28.520 --> 15:30.190
That's why you have formulas!

15:30.660 --> 15:31.590
Oh, really?

15:32.660 --> 15:36.330
Ah, I'm hungry and I can't think.

15:36.330 --> 15:39.800
Chocolat-chan, I'll go buy a sandwich at the store.

15:41.270 --> 15:43.040
Thanks a bunch, Vanilla.

15:46.610 --> 15:52.550
She's so nice... Of course Vanilla would be popular.

15:53.110 --> 15:57.730
Oh, no, I... I'm not really in love with Ice-san.

15:58.390 --> 15:59.560
You know, Kato-san...

16:00.220 --> 16:03.390
I've got a cousin who can do anything.

16:05.060 --> 16:08.360
Even though were the same age,
when I compare myself to him,

16:08.360 --> 16:11.600
I'm always left thinking I'm no good.

16:12.270 --> 16:17.040
But even if I'm no good now, that doesn't
mean I'll be that way forever.

16:18.370 --> 16:21.080
So, Kato-san, you should try harder.

16:23.140 --> 16:26.150
For example, you should do all
these handouts by tomorrow.

16:26.650 --> 16:28.320
Tomorrow?!

16:28.320 --> 16:29.380
Push yourself!

16:30.050 --> 16:33.390
I'm sure Ice-san would try that hard.

16:40.790 --> 16:43.300
I'll do it! I should do it, right!

16:43.960 --> 16:44.760
Wrong!

16:46.400 --> 16:47.430
Wrong!

16:49.070 --> 16:50.070
That's totally wrong!

16:52.970 --> 16:57.480
Well, you put the effort into it and finished,
but if it's not correct, there's no point to it.

16:58.210 --> 16:59.480
Redo them again.

17:00.210 --> 17:03.350
The formula for getting the area of a trapezoid is...

17:03.350 --> 17:06.420
Add the lengths of the bases
and multiply by the height...

17:06.420 --> 17:07.520
And divide by two!

17:07.520 --> 17:08.460
I knew that!

17:08.820 --> 17:11.260
I told you 'cause you don't know.

17:11.260 --> 17:13.330
This is so frustrating!

17:13.330 --> 17:16.860
If you're so frustrated, make sure to
memorize the formulas properly.

17:16.860 --> 17:17.970
'Course I will!

17:24.270 --> 17:25.390
Ice-san, is something...

17:25.810 --> 17:29.740
It just seems like you have fun when you're
with Chocolat-chan, Shinohara-senpai.

17:30.880 --> 17:32.310
It's nothing like that.

17:33.550 --> 17:35.620
Um, the area of a circle is...

17:36.080 --> 17:39.890
Chocolat, I won't let you get in Vanilla-chama's way!

17:36.080 --> 17:40.620
The radius times the radius times four! Or was it 3...?

17:46.090 --> 17:47.080
Kato-san!

17:47.080 --> 17:48.290
Chocolat-chan!

17:49.900 --> 17:51.400
Are you okay?

17:51.870 --> 17:54.230
Man, that was so un-cool.

18:01.710 --> 18:03.280
An orange heart!

18:04.750 --> 18:12.240
Um, the radius times the radius
times... 3.14! Right, Senpai?

18:12.590 --> 18:14.020
Right, that's correct.

18:16.990 --> 18:19.450
I can't eat anymore.

18:19.450 --> 18:21.460
I've got to try, try...

18:21.460 --> 18:22.860
Try again!

18:22.860 --> 18:25.870
Everyone try hard on tomorrow's math test!

18:29.840 --> 18:32.210
Hey, that calculations wrong.

18:32.210 --> 18:34.510
Ah, I'm tired.

18:34.510 --> 18:38.640
I'm tired too, teaching someone
who just doesn't get it.

18:39.280 --> 18:41.680
Oh, I see. I'm sorry.

18:43.120 --> 18:46.390
I've been interrupting you from studying yourself.

18:47.390 --> 18:48.190
No, it's...

18:48.760 --> 18:51.620
Is there something I can do?

18:55.000 --> 18:55.760
That's it!

18:56.700 --> 18:58.360
I'm going to the bathroom for a bit, okay?

19:02.500 --> 19:05.490
Sugar Sugar Rune, Choco Rune!

19:05.490 --> 19:07.270
Southern Islands, appear!

19:20.520 --> 19:22.690
What the...? Where am I?

19:22.690 --> 19:24.320
What a beautiful sunset.

19:25.660 --> 19:29.560
The smell of the ocean, and the sound of waves...

19:30.200 --> 19:34.270
It's nice to study in a place like
this once in a while, right?

19:46.950 --> 19:47.870
Huh?

19:48.420 --> 19:51.370
Aww, the magic disappeared already.

19:53.350 --> 19:55.420
I really must be tired...

19:56.320 --> 19:58.290
Okay, let's continue studying.

19:58.290 --> 19:59.430
Okay!

20:01.430 --> 20:04.430
Um, the area of a trapezoid is...

20:04.900 --> 20:08.100
The sum of the bases times the height divided by two!

20:05.300 --> 20:08.100
She's completely forgotten about taking his heart.

20:09.840 --> 20:15.880
Today's math test covers only the basics,
so everyone try their best.

20:19.080 --> 20:23.780
Alright! I've never gotten such
a great grade on a math test!

20:23.780 --> 20:26.200
80%, huh? You really tried hard.

20:27.020 --> 20:29.700
Thanks! It's all because of you, Senpai!

20:30.190 --> 20:32.260
I, uh, didn't really...

20:32.930 --> 20:34.090
A pink heart...

20:38.100 --> 20:40.770
That heart's for me?

20:41.670 --> 20:43.470
C... Congratulations...

20:45.340 --> 20:46.220
Senpai?

20:46.640 --> 20:48.110
Chocolat-chan.

20:48.110 --> 20:52.280
But it's okay, that heart's for Chocolat-chan.

20:52.950 --> 20:57.080
Why does my heart beat like that when I'm near her?

21:03.090 --> 21:04.420
Shinohara-san...

21:06.830 --> 21:07.730
Kato-san.

21:10.360 --> 21:14.370
It was fun, the time we spent studying together.

21:15.070 --> 21:18.400
Looking at all your strange expressions.

21:18.910 --> 21:24.410
And when you said "thank you" back
then, it really made me happy.

21:29.120 --> 21:31.880
Sugar Sugar Rune, Choco Rune!

21:32.390 --> 21:37.410
Your heart, pick up!

21:48.470 --> 21:53.710
Shinohara-senpai, thanks again.

21:54.210 --> 21:56.690
Yeah. Do your best on the next test, okay?

21:57.240 --> 21:58.160
Sure!

21:58.610 --> 21:59.280
Bye.

22:03.280 --> 22:06.190
Who someone falls in love with...

22:07.090 --> 22:09.160
...is more mysterious than magic.

22:23.180 --> 22:29.510
I light a red candle, and whisper:

22:29.600 --> 22:31.010
"Love"

22:31.920 --> 22:35.430
A magic spell.

22:37.560 --> 22:44.840
With you, there's nothing to be afraid of... probably.

22:46.270 --> 22:54.340
Please hold me. Where am I going?

22:56.020 --> 23:00.290
Take me along, take me along,

23:00.890 --> 23:03.950
To the world beyond the moon.

23:04.260 --> 23:11.330
It doesn't matter if everyone stops.

23:12.700 --> 23:16.140
To the world beyond the moon.

23:18.140 --> 23:26.250
I'll be waiting in the real world.

23:26.310 --> 23:35.220
The eternal world of which you spoke.

23:46.570 --> 23:50.690
I might not be so good at magic, but I kick butt at sports!

23:51.070 --> 23:56.700
I'll show everyone how cool I am at the sports festival relay and get all the boys' hearts!

23:57.290 --> 24:01.650
Well, that's one part, but I also just hate to lose!

24:01.650 --> 24:05.090
Got it? Everyone, if you go out there, you'd better win!

24:06.470 --> 24:08.500
Next time on Sugar Sugar Rune:

24:08.500 --> 24:10.500
Run, Run! Friendship Relay

24:11.110 --> 24:13.740
I'm gonna whup some butt out there. Thanks!
